## 4. **Side-by-Side / Column Layout**

**CSS File:** [packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/app.css](packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/app.css#L225-L280)

**Layout Control:**
```css
