**Resize Handle:**
No explicit resize handle visible — layout is controlled by the preview-width picker buttons (monitor/tablet/phone icons) in the preview header.

**Preview Height Sizing:**
```css
#preview {
  border: 0 none;
  overflow: hidden;
  width: 100%;
  margin-inline: auto;
}

.preview-pane.-fullscreen #preview {
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  min-height: 0;
  overflow: auto;  /* Allow scroll in fullscreen */
}
```

Dynamic height managed via `ResizeObserver` + `MutationObserver` ([main.ts.tmpl:1122-1148](packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/main.ts.tmpl#L1122-L1148)):
```typescript
function resizePreviewFrame(): void {
  if (previewPane.classList.contains("-fullscreen")) {
    previewFrame.style.removeProperty("height");
    return;
  }
  const root = previewFrame.contentDocument?.documentElement;
  const body = previewFrame.contentDocument?.body;
  const style = getComputedStyle(body);
  const margins = Number.parseFloat(style.marginTop) + Number.parseFloat(style.marginBottom);
  const height = Math.ceil(Math.max(root.getBoundingClientRect().height, body.offsetHeight + margins));
  previewFrame.style.height = `${height + PREVIEW_BORDER_PX}px`;
}
```

**Layout Toggle Button:** [app.html:26-31](packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/app.html#L26-L31)
