---

## Icon Light/Dark Swap Pattern (Established)

**Pattern Used Throughout:**

1. **TinyMCE's Global CSS Variables** (auto-adapts to dark mode):
   ```css
   /* global-custom-properties.less */
   --tox-private-text-color: light-dark(var(--tox-private-color-black), var(--tox-private-color-white));
   --tox-private-background-color: light-dark(#fff, #222f3e);
   ```

2. **SVG Icon Rendering (stroke-based)**:
   ```typescript
   // icon-pack.ts line 106
   '<svg style="fill: none; stroke: currentColor" ...>'
   ```

3. **CSS-Painted Icon (mask-image pattern)**:
   ```css
   /* icon-picker-styles.ts lines 32–34 */
   .instui-icon[class*="-icon-"]::before {
     background: currentColor;  /* Inherits from color: property */
     mask: var(--pantoken-glyph) center / contain no-repeat;
   }
   ```

4. **Toolbar Button Icon Colors**:
   ```less
   /* toolbar-button.less line 108 */
   @toolbar-button-icon-color: contrast(@background-color, @color-white, @color-black);
   .tox-tbtn svg { fill: @toolbar-button-icon-color; }
   ```

All follow the principle: **inherit or reference a theme-aware color variable rather than hardcoding**.

